        <mxCell id="ddText" value="- APM / traces (dd-java-agent)&lt;br&gt;- Logs com dd.trace_id&lt;br&gt;- Metricas de infra e custom&lt;br&gt;- Synthetics por provedor&lt;br&gt;- RUM (app / web)&lt;br&gt;- AWS Integration&lt;br&gt;- SLO de latencia e erro&lt;br&gt;  POR ENDPOINT externo&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Sem DBM: nao ha banco." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#432466;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2315" y="435" width="225" height="255" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
